docs {
  # getRBCTransmitRate

  Get the current RBC transmit rate value in milliseconds.

  ## Required service level

  `none`

  ## Body

  `none`

  ## Response

  `200 OK`

  - `Value`: integer (0..65535)

  ### Example

  ```json
  {
	"Value": 100
  }
  ```
}

